# Local runtime/dev tooling (machine-specific, not project code)
# run.bat is NOT ignored: every path in it is derived from %~dp0 at runtime,
# so it contains no machine-specific or personal information. data/ holds the
# PIDs of the running servers and is genuinely per-machine.
data/

